Reply Text=No, and we're not all so bloodthirsty, either!
Go to node ID=100 combat
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=2 PC Enters the village again, before completing any quest
Text=Ooh, you're back.  My momma says I shouldn't hang around no-account losers like you, but I think she's just jealous.  She's old and dried up and bitter and can't understand our bizarre interspecies love!
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Frankly, neither can I. Don't you have something... else to do?
Go to node ID=80 Rebuffed

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Although I have nothing against goblins in general, you in particular really need to die.
Go to node ID=100 combat

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I'll kill the old hag if she stands in our way.  Now, give me some sugar, baby!
Go to node ID=5 Give me some sugar
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=5 Give me some sugar
Text=Oooh, you're as bold as a weasel, but you'll have to prove yourself.  You won't find a girl like me under a rock every day, you'll have to prove you're as wicked as you are cute if you want to claim the Khan's daughter!
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You're the Khan's daughter?  I never realized how cratered and diseased your complexion is, my little snail.
Go to node ID=7 sugar part 2

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Ah, your father must be very wealthy...  I mean, he's, umm, lucky to have a daughter as sweet as you.
Go to node ID=80 Rebuffed
